        "main_topic": [
         {
          "h_title": "Grooming Requirements",
          "main_title": "\u200bCavapoo",
          "author": "The Lovely Pets",
          "language": "en",
          "level": 2,
          "primary_content": [
           {
            "text": "Cavapoos have a soft, curly or wavy coat that requires regular grooming to keep it clean, tangle-free, and healthy. The grooming requirements for a Cavapoo may vary depending on the length and thickness of their coat, but in general, they need to be brushed and groomed at least once a week.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "Brushing: Daily brushing is important to prevent tangle.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "Bathing: Cavapoos needs to be bathed every week in Singapore\u2019s humid climate. Use a mild dog shampoo (we recommend\u00a0Silky shampoo) and be sure to rinse thoroughly to avoid any skin irritation. Lastly, remember to blow dry to make sure the skin is completely dry to prevent skin issues.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "Trimming: Regular haircut is needed at\u00a0professional dog groomer\u00a0every 2-3 months for a full grooming service to prevent tangle and keep a neat appearance. There are many styles at your dog can try out to create many different look.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "Nail Clipping:\u00a0The toe nails need to be clipped once every few months. Best to ask a professional groomer to do this to prevent bleeding when the nails are cut too close to the quick (blood vessel).\u00a0avoid cutting too close to the quick.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "Teeth Cleaning:\u00a0Brushing teeth daily is preferred, if not possible, weekly brushing is sufficient. Give raw bones regularly as enrichment which double as natural teeth cleaner.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "Ear Cleaning:\u00a0Their ears may be prone to infection as it is dropping down which can trap heat and moisture especially in Singapore\u2019s humid climate. Clean the ears with appropriate solution once a week.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           }
          ],
          "secondary_content": [
           {
            "text": "Here are some grooming requirements and recommendations for Cavapoos:",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           }
          ],
          "table_content": null
         }
        ],
        "secondary_topic": [
         {
          "h_title": "\u200bCavapoo",
          "main_title": "\u200bCavapoo",
          "author": "The Lovely Pets",
          "language": "en",
          "level": 1,
          "primary_content": null,
          "secondary_content": [
           {
            "text": "Showing all 5 results Sorted by latest",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "Cavapoo is a very popular designer dog which is a cross between Cavalier King Charles and Poodle. They are extremely in demand in Singapore as they have good looks and friendly temperament. Their hair is typically wavy hence do not need as frequent brushing compared to the curly hair of poodle. Yet when bred right, they are mostly non shedding which appeals to people with allergy. Cavalier temperament is also very kind and friendly. Hence the resulting mix create a perfect small medium size family dog.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "Whether you are looking to adopt a Cavapoo puppy or finding out the price, you can contact us to help you make the best decision for you and your family.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           }
          ],
          "table_content": null
         },
